"dom0 <https://www.qubes-os.org/doc/how-to-copy-from-dom0/#copying-to-"
"dom0>`__ and install it via ``sudo dnf install PATH_TO_RPMFILE``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:226
#: 724ae3cddc3841a6bd5c26e83cf0e760
msgid ""
"For use with **Windows 10 and 11**, you have to install the new version "
"4.2.2 of Qubes Windows Tools. In Qubes R4.3, the QWT package is already part "
"of the repositories. So, QWT can be installed directy, without downloading "
"anything, via"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:233
#: 7dabf110e3504fabb134a0048d837f9a
msgid ""
"**Caution:** Installing one of these QWT versions will remove the other if "
