#: 2ce3d3eeda8d4a35a1f61e1939f1dea6
msgid ""
"**Caution:** For Windows 7, the installation of the graphics driver in the "
"first step will probably break the Windows qube, causing it to show only a "
"black window and become unresponsive; the graphics driver has to be "
"installed later on in a second step described below. For Windows 10 and 11, "
"the Qubes graphics driver is still in experimental development. It may work "
"or not, possibly depending on your hardware. So, in Windows 10 and 11, it "
"may be less risky to install Qubes Windows Tools without selecting this "
